        "66232a31-cb5f-4a67-97cf-d0377bb2fac6": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How To Use",
            "content": "<ol><li><strong>Cleanse Skin<\/strong>: Ensure the forehead area is clean and free from oils or makeup.<\/li><li><strong>Apply Conductive Serum<\/strong>: Lightly spritz the area with 7E Wellness Replenish Spritzer or apply a water-based serum. Avoid oil-based products.<\/li><li><strong>Prepare the Mask<\/strong>: Peel the plastic backing from the mask.<\/li><li><strong>Connect to Device<\/strong>: Plug the mask into the lead wire and connect it to your MyoLift™ device.<\/li><li><strong>Position the Mask<\/strong>: Place the mask on your forehead, ensuring proper contact with the skin.<\/li><li><strong>Select Settings<\/strong>: Use the Educate or Erase setting on your device, adjusting the frequency as needed.<\/li><li><strong>Treatment Duration<\/strong>: Apply for 10–30 minutes, dividing the time between the Educate and Erase settings.<\/li><li><strong>Post-Treatment Care<\/strong>: Remove the mask, clean any residue, and store it in a sealed bag for future use<\/li><\/ol>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Benefits",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Reduces Fine Lines and Wrinkles<\/strong>: Targets aging signs on the forehead.<\/li><li><strong>Stimulates Collagen and Elastin Production<\/strong>: Enhances skin elasticity and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.7ewellness.com\/collections\/shop-by-concern-firmness\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/www.7ewellness.com\/collections\/shop-by-concern-firmness\">firmness<\/a>.<\/li><li><strong>Improves Skin Tone and Texture<\/strong>: Promotes a smoother and more youthful complexion.<\/li><li><strong>Convenient and Easy to Use<\/strong>: Ideal for at-home treatments.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Cost-Effective<\/strong>: Reusable design offers multiple treatments per mask<br\/><br\/><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "c470f05f-1b5f-4fc2-8e60-fc45d6f483ed": {
